The following were ported from cloudlands-fe and modified for Arpli:

  apps/desktop/src/app.css
  apps/desktop/src/lib/styles/          (design tokens, overlay surface, option rows)
  apps/desktop/src/lib/motion/          (motion tiers, transitions, animated height)
  apps/desktop/src/lib/interaction/
  apps/desktop/src/lib/components/ui/   (UI kit)
  apps/desktop/src/lib/components/patterns/
  apps/desktop/src/lib/components/shared/icons/, src/lib/icons/phosphor-icons.ts
  apps/desktop/src/lib/utils/, src/lib/i18n/, src/lib/actions/, src/lib/hooks/,
  apps/desktop/src/shared/i18n/ (supporting utilities)
  apps/desktop/messages/en.json         (subset of UI strings)

Modifications include: removing Intent-specific components and branding (the Intent
mark loader is replaced by a neutral spinner), replacing Redux-backed state with local
equivalents, an English-only message module in place of Paraglide, and removal of
tests and catalog metadata.

